from h34 import *
M=mcq;F=tf;S=short;N=num
chapter(3,'evs','food-we-eat','Food We Eat',
 ('Shirin the runner','Shirin is in Class 3 and runs faster than everyone in her class. A champion runner tells her she can win medals if she practises a lot and eats healthy food. Shirin says she likes only rice and potatoes, and the champion advises her to eat a variety of foods. This chapter tells us why we need food and water and what a balanced diet is.'),
 [('Why we eat and drink',['We all like different foods. Some are sweet, some sour, some spicy and some bitter.','We eat and drink to get energy, to grow, to stay healthy and to fight sickness. Without food and water we could not play, study or run.','Chhappan bhog is a special feast of 56 kinds of food prepared on festivals and auspicious occasions, with a blend of six tastes: sweet, spicy, astringent, sour, salty and bitter.']),
  ('A balanced diet',['Shirin ate only rice and potatoes and often fell sick. The champion told her to eat many different foods: different vegetables and fruits, things made from different grains such as rice, ragi, jowar, wheat and bajra, pulses (dal) and nuts.','A balanced diet means eating a variety of foods in the right amounts. Each food gives our body something different.','Home-cooked food is good for us. Shirin followed the advice, ate a variety of homemade food, practised harder and became faster. She won a medal for her school.','Foods like sweets, fried snacks and cold drinks are enjoyable, but they should not be our main food.']),
  ('Food in different seasons and places',['In summer we love kulfi and tender coconut water. In winter we eat warm food, soups and hot drinks.','Different fruits and vegetables are available in different seasons. Mangoes and melons come in the summer, and plenty of apples come in winter.','In hot weather we sweat and lose water from our body. So we drink more water, buttermilk, lime water, aam panna, sugarcane juice and tender coconut water.','We also sweat when we play, so we should drink water often. Water is life because we cannot live without it.','People in different parts of our country eat different foods.']),
  ('Where our food comes from',['Many foods are grown in fields as crops. Many come from plants, and some come from animals.','We eat different parts of plants. Leaves such as spinach, fenugreek, coriander, cabbage and mustard. Fruits like guava, apple and mango. Roots like carrot, radish and beetroot. Stems like potatoes, ginger and onion. Seeds like grains, pulses and nuts.','Some foods come from animals, such as milk, curd, ghee, cheese, paneer, honey and eggs. Some people eat meat and fish.','We cook food in different ways, such as boiling, frying and roasting. We eat some foods raw, such as salads and fruits.'])],
 [('Why did Shirin often fall sick even though she practised a lot?',[('She ate only rice and potatoes.','Her food had little variety.'),('A body needs many kinds of food.','Different foods give different things.'),('After she ate a balanced diet, she became healthy and fast.','A balanced diet keeps us strong.')]),
  ('Why do we drink more water in summer?',[('It is hot and we sweat.','Sweat is water from the body.'),('We lose water when we sweat.','The body needs it back.'),('So we drink water, buttermilk or lime water.','These help our body.')])],
 ('Tell what a balanced diet is and why Shirin needed it.',['Many kinds of food','Vegetables, fruits, grains, pulses','Home-cooked food','Strong, energetic body'],['Only rice is enough','Fried snacks are the best food']),
 ['We eat food to get energy, to grow and to stay healthy.','A balanced diet has many kinds of food.','We eat different parts of plants and some foods from animals.','In summer we drink more water as we sweat.','Home-cooked food is good for us.'],
 [M('1',1,'What did Shirin like to eat only?','Rice and potatoes',[('Fruits and milk','She ate only rice and potatoes'),('Dal and nuts','She ate only rice and potatoes')],'She did not eat a variety.'),
  M('2',1,'What advice did the champion give Shirin?','Eat a variety of foods and practise',[('Stop running','The champion said practise'),('Eat only sweets','Sweets are not enough')],'Eat variety and practise.'),
  M('3',1,'What is chhappan bhog?','A feast of 56 kinds of food',[('A game','It is food'),('A dress','It is food')],'A special festival feast.'),
  M('4',1,'Why do we eat food?','To get energy and grow',[('To make noise','Food gives energy'),('For fun only','Food has a purpose')],'Food gives energy and helps us grow.'),
  M('5',2,'Which is a leaf we eat?','Spinach',[('Carrot','Carrot is a root'),('Mango','Mango is a fruit')],'Spinach is a leaf.'),
  M('6',2,'Which is a root we eat?','Carrot',[('Cabbage','Cabbage is a leaf'),('Guava','Guava is a fruit')],'Carrot is a root.'),
  M('7',2,'Which food comes from an animal?','Honey',[('Rice','Rice is a grain'),('Mango','Mango is a fruit')],'Honey is made by bees.'),
  F('8',2,'We lose water from our body when we sweat.',True,'Sweat is water, so we should drink more.'),
  M('9',2,'Which drink is good in hot weather?','Lime water',[('Hot tea only','Cool drinks help'),('Oil','Oil is not a drink')],'Lime water helps us get water and salts.'),
  M('10',2,'Which grain is used to make roti?','Wheat',[('Moong','Moong is a pulse'),('Carrot','Carrot is a root')],'Roti is made from wheat or other grains.'),
  F('11',3,'Eating only one kind of food is healthy.',False,'We need many kinds of food.'),
  S('12',3,'What do we call eating many different foods in the right amounts?',['balanced diet','a balanced diet'],'A balanced diet.')],
 keep=['balanced diet','grains','pulses'])
